\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{Summing with the links fixed}
\date{2026-11-19}

\p{A fixed link assignment still admits every scalar configuration.
Some assignments can carry more total weight than others once all
the scalars have been summed out. Which coefficient normalizes these
link weights, and which coefficient is needed to condition on one
particular assignment?}
